speechtext:
I want to know what right the federal government has to ask the taxpayers of Canada to build a tunnel for the city of Toronto. This is a purely civic matter and as far as I have heard this afternoon it has nothing to do with the federal government.
92582-182}
I should like to know what right the federal government has to spend a million dollars to build a tunnel from the mainland in Toronto to a little island ten feet or a hundred feet away.
